{
  "mod": {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 2588,
      "hub_id": null,
      "guid": "com.massivesoft.massivesoftweapons",
      "name": "MassivesoftWeapons",
      "slug": "massivesoftweapons",
      "teaser": "Collection of my and saintdeer's weapons for SPT 4.0.0+",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/odY9Z2Odh84q7XTGmTSAnpYg6cggpDJVW4onEke7.png",
      "downloads": 33045,
      "favourites_count": 93,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/Ezawa-Riki/MassivesoftWeapons/blob/main/images/total.png?raw=true\" alt=\"total\" />\nCollection of most of my weapon mod posted and and saintdeer’s GRAU.</p>\n<p><strong>Included Weapons:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>🔹 <strong>(New)</strong>  <em>Katana Nikitakiri</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <strong>(New)</strong>  <em>FSS Hurricane 5.7x28 Submachine Gun</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <strong>(New)</strong>  <em>Tempus 725 12ga Double-Barrel Shotgun</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <strong>(New)</strong>  <em>Kalashnikov \"RPKN\" 7.62x39 Light Machine Gun</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <strong>(New)</strong>  <em>JAK AR-15 5.56x45 Assault Rifle</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>BAL-27 5.7x28 Assualt Rifle</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>DG-56 5.56x45 Assualt Rifle</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>GRAU 5.56x45/7.62x39 Rifles</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>ISO .45ACP/9x19 Submachinguns</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>ISO Hemlock 5.56x45/7.62x51/.300blk Assualt Rifles</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>JAK-12 12ga Automatic Shotgun</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>KATT AMR .50 BMG Bolt-action Rifle</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>Longbow 7.62x39 Bolt-action Rifle</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>M14 7.62x51 Rifle</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>MCW 5.56x45 Assualt Rifles</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>MCX 5.56x45 Barrel</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>MHG Hand Grenades</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>New COD Mags from MW</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>QBZ-03 5.56x45 Assualt Rifle</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>QBZ-97 5.56x45 Assualt Rifle</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>Superi46 4.6x30 Submachinegun</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>TR75/76/77 Assualt Rifles</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>Type 64 7.62x25 Slienced Submachinegun</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>Vector .308 Assualt Rifle</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>CQ-A 5.56x45 Assault Rifle</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>Molot Arms VPO-209 FA .366 TKM Carbine</em></li>\n<li>🔹 <em>Various New Ammo</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>All sound bundles have been rebuilt to fix the issue where gunfire sounds did not change according to the environment (indoor/outdoor)</strong></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Decompress and put the folder <strong>SPT</strong> under <strong>[Your EFT Directory]/</strong></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Notice</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>\n<p>Not completely compatible with profile created with AmightyTank’s <strong>Massivesoft Gun</strong> due to the inconsistent ID used by GRAU. Remove anything related with GRAU <strong>might</strong> work.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Tavor X95 &amp; X95-R</strong> is not included since WTT have a better one.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>To disable a certain component, remove the coresponding folder under <strong>MassivesoftWeapons/subs/</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Theoretically compatible with Fika and WTT-armory. Not fully tested. No guarantee.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>All models, textures, audio and animations ported from other games belongs to their respective original owner. No commercial use of this mod is allowed.</p>\n</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Some Pictures</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/Ezawa-Riki/MassivesoftWeapons/blob/main/images/725.png?raw=true\" alt=\"T725\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/Ezawa-Riki/MassivesoftWeapons/blob/main/images/Katana.png?raw=true\" alt=\"katana\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/Ezawa-Riki/MassivesoftWeapons/blob/main/images/FSSH.png?raw=true?raw=true\" alt=\"fssh\" /></p></div></div></div>\n",
