          "id": 13872,
          "hub_id": null,
          "version": "1.1.1",
          "description": "New:\n- Brand new melee weapon: **Katana Nikitakiri**\n  - Custom animation and sound effect. \n  - Model and texture assets came from https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/katana-aec45be9d79d4c0885c2ec7fb106fd4b with **CC Attribution**.\n\nFixes:\n- **(IMPORTANT)** Fixed T725 faulty data json causing server crash when using with some mods.\n- Fixed type64 SMG hand not gripping on right places.\n- Fixed BAL-27 inspect animation pressing magazine release button not on the right place.\n- Fixed QBZs and JAK-12 shot sound. Now they sound more naturely at distance.\n- Fixed some locales.\n\nChanges:\n- Reworked JAK-12 based on AA-12 armature.",
