        {
          "id": 13694,
          "hub_id": null,
          "version": "1.1.0",
          "description": "**IMPORTANT:**\n**If you are experiencing server crashes with this update, download the fix in the addons.**\n\nNew:\n- FSS Harricane 5.7x28 submachine gun (Not AR-57, COD MW II)\n- Tempus 725 12ga double-barrel shotgun (Not 725, COD MW)\n- Kalashnikov \\\"RPKN\\\" 7.62x39 light machine gun (Not a true RPK, COD MW II)\n- JAK AR-15 5.56x45 assault rifle (3D-Printed AR-15, COD MW III)\n- Something else\n\nFixes:\n- Fixed some locales define order so that none Ch or En client will load En locales first.\n- Fixed some locales error.\n- Fixed M14 animation error when using a 10-round mag.\n- Disabled malfunction for weapons with faulty malfunction statemachine or animation.\n\nChanges:\n- New transparent material for BAL-27 mag.\n- Changed acquiring method for some items.\n",
